1
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:04,160
歌洛莉亚 确保不能让杰发现
Okay, Gloria, just make sure Jay doesn't find out.

2
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:05,600
天呐
Oh. Boy.

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,820
我刚意识到
I just heard that.

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:10,140
你该误会我和歌洛莉亚有情况了吧
You probably think there's something between me and Gloria.

5
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:10,940
别紧张
Relax.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,200
我昏迷的时候都没有现在这么放松
I couldn't be more relaxed if I was in a coma.

7
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,160
杰的烤架刚刚送到
Jay's grill was delivered.

8
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,920
她把烤架藏起来
She's keeping it under wraps

9
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,440
等我到的时候再给他看
so I can be there when he sees it!

10
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,240
天呐
Oh, my God!

11
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,820
我刚被加州理工录取了
I just got accepted into Caltech.

12
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,860
真的吗
You did?!

13
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,420
太棒了
That is incredible!

14
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,060
我们家要出大科学家了
We're gonna have a famous scientist in the family!

15
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:29,140
学一门实在的手艺也没什么可耻的
Uh, not that there's any shame in learning a trade.

16
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,861
空调总是会坏掉的
Air conditioners are always gonna break.

17
00:00:30,861 --> 00:00:33,500
我查过了 要上的课太多了
Eh, I looked into it. It's a lot of classes.

18
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,200
亲爱的 真是不可思议
Honey, that is unbelievable.

19
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,079
没什么不可思议的
It's hardly unbelievable.

20
00:00:37,079 --> 00:00:39,519
超厉害小孩 上超厉害学校
Super-smart kid, super-smart school.

21
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,440
我从不怀疑你
I never doubted you.

22
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,680
一定感觉很棒
That must feel great.

23
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:42,900
对啊 棒极了
Yep. Pretty great.

24
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,100
这是怎么回事
What was that?

25
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:47,360
我觉得是我的错
I think that was my fault.

26
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,580
我也觉得 为什么
Me too. Why?

27
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:50,020
我总是这样
I do this all the time.

28
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:52,420
她这么了不起 而我却习以为常了
She does these amazing things, and I'm so used to it,

29
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:54,100
被加州理工录取我都没太当回事
I don't even make a big deal over Caltech.

30
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,758
我这么兴奋 这还不算吗
I got excited. Doesn't that count?

31
00:00:55,758 --> 00:00:57,380
亲爱的 什么事都会让你兴奋
Well, honey, you get excited over everything.

32
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,680
你天生就是个啦啦队长
You're a born cheerleader.

33
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:02,180
我今天要给艾丽克斯好好宣传庆祝一下
I just need to make a really big fuss over Alex today.

34
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:03,000
就这样
That's all.

35
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,240
我知道 你不爽
I know -- you're upset

36
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:04,840
因为我说你天生是个
because I said that you were a born --

37
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,220
没有什么天生的啦啦队长
There's no such thing as a born cheerleader.

38
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,560
刻苦训练 作出大量牺牲才能当上的
It takes hard work and sacrifice.

39
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,000
你知道没有充分训练
You know what a human pyramid

40
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,400
就跳人体金字塔会怎么样吗
is without hours of training?

41
00:01:10,892 --> 00:01:12,694
10条人命就没了
10 obituaries.

42
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:28,920
我想我爸今年会很享受退掉礼物的过程
I think my dad is really gonna enjoy returning his gift this year.

43
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:31,080
米奇尔 我有个非常悲伤的消息
Mitchell, I have some really sad news.

44
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:32,620
是啊 看你心都碎了
Yes, you seem very broken up.

45
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:35,580
是这样 我有个叔叔 叫赛勒斯
Apparently, I had an uncle, uh, Cyrus,

46
00:01:35,580 --> 00:01:37,039
去世了 竟给我留了一笔
who died and out of the blue

47
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:39,680
相当可观的遗产
left me a pretty handsome sum.

48
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:41,020
我猜他没什么近亲吧
I-I guess he didn't have a lot of other kin.

49
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:43,280
只有这次我不介意你说这个词
Okay, this is the one time I don't mind you saying "Kin."

50
00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:44,801
你说"可观的"[英俊的]
Now, when you say "handsome,"

51
00:01:44,801 --> 00:01:46,760
是指莉莉学校里那个拼车的父亲
are we talking carpool dad at Lily's school

52
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,756
还是更像克鲁尼或者皮特那样的
or are we in a more Clooney/Pitt area?

53
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,860
我觉得是哈利·哈姆林那样的
I would say more Harry Hamlin.

54
00:01:50,873 --> 00:01:52,400
那还真是不错
That's not bad at --

55
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,680
相当不错啊
That's not bad at all.

56
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:56,320
真是不可思议 因为我刚刚看到
You know, and this is crazy, because, um, I just saw

57
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,680
楼上的房子开始出售了
that the upstairs unit went back on the market,

58
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:01,929
这笔哈利·哈姆林正好够首付
and Harry Hamlin would almost equal a down payment, and --

59
00:02:01,929 --> 00:02:03,340
我 抱歉 抱歉
I'm -- I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

60
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:04,200
瞧我 随意决定如何花你的钱
Look at me, spending your money.

61
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:05,880
不 米奇尔 这不是我的钱
No, Mitchell, it's not my money.

62
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:06,680
是我们的钱
It's our money.

63
00:02:07,032 --> 00:02:08,720
这是个信号吗 小卡
I-is this a sign, Cam?

64
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,840
我们一直都在说这事
I mean, we talk about it all the time.

65
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,900
我们应该把楼上的公寓买下来
We should buy that upstairs apartment.

66
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,820
为什么不买呢
I don't see a reason why not!

67
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,580
真是太棒了
This is so exciting.

68
00:02:16,780 --> 00:02:17,680
我知道
I know.

69
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,580
我真为你骄傲
I'm really proud of you,

70
00:02:18,580 --> 00:02:20,040
因为曾经有段时间
because there was a time

71
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:22,080
我根本不可能看到这张支票
when I wouldn't have even seen this check.

72
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,240
是啊
Oh, well, yes.

73
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,100
我以前老是冲动消费
You know, I used to be quite the impulse buyer.

74
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:27,158
但我再也不是那样的人了
But I don't even recognize that guy anymore.

75
00:02:27,158 --> 00:02:29,620
我喜欢我的新人造貂皮大衣 大爸
I love my new faux mink, daddy.

76
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:31,644
我又忘了 我是嘉宝姐妹中的哪个来着
I forgot -- which Gabor sister am I?

77
00:02:31,644 --> 00:02:33,440
你是艾娃 漂亮的那个 但是听我说
Y-you're Eva, the classy one, but listen.

78
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:35,520
我们得留着吊牌 因为要把衣服退回去
We need to keep the tags on it, because it's going back.

79
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:37,320
那你的也得退
Well, then yours is going back, too.

80
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,480
不行 那太难了
No, that's a hard thing,

81
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,918
因为店员说我穿上像日瓦戈医生
because the saleslady said I look like Dr. Zhivago.

82
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:45,440
所以这算是你的生日礼物
So, is that a birthday present for you

83
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:47,500
还是你在经历严重迟到的中年危机
or an extremely late mid-life crisis?

84
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:49,600
"严重"这词没必要吧
I don't think "extremely" is necessary.

85
00:02:49,728 --> 00:02:52,902
这是借的 一周的试驾期
It's on loan -- kind of a weekend-long test-drive.

86
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,760
我走进一家店
I walk into a store,

87
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,760
他们害我把我的背包留给了他们
they make me leave my backpack behind the counter.

88
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,580
这是汽车销售员的惯用策略
It's an old car salesman's trick.

89
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:00,600
他们希望我爱上这辆车 然后买下
They're hoping I fall in love with it and never give it back.

90
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,880
但我找不到买这辆车的理由
But I can't justify buying it

91
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,880
就像你没有理由买那顶帽子
any more than you can justify that hat.

92
00:03:06,260 --> 00:03:07,820
现在喝龙舌兰酒有点早吧
Little early for tequila, isn't it?

93
00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:08,600
给卢克的
It's for Luke.

94
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,780
这理由有更合适吗
Not sure that's better.

95
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,960
他上次来的时候
The last time he was here,

96
00:03:10,980 --> 00:03:13,180
他看这瓶酒的样子 跟你看到我
he was eyeing this bottle the same way you look at me

97
00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:14,680
穿吊带裙时的样子一模一样
when I wear that strappy sundress.

98
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,915
我真的很喜欢那条裙子
I do like that dress.

99
00:03:15,915 --> 00:03:17,620
我要抓他个现行
I am going to catch him red-handed.

100
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:19,380
给他点教训
I am going to teach him a lesson.

101
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,660
但我要先在这酒瓶里装上白水
But first I'm going to refill this with water

102
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:23,080
免得他趁我没注意真的喝了
in case he gets past me.

103
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:25,059
他们还要再过会儿才到
You know, we have a little time before the family comes.

104
00:03:25,059 --> 00:03:26,816
要不你穿上那条裙子
Why don't you throw that dress on and --

105
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:28,700
该死
Aw, damn it.

106
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:29,740
安迪 你能去开门吗
Andy, can you get that?

107
00:03:29,900 --> 00:03:30,300
安迪
Andy?

108
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:31,900
抱歉
Sorry.

109
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:33,460
你们开始调情的时候我就没在听了
I tuned out when you started flirting

110
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:34,480
好给你们一点私人空间
to give you some privacy.

111
00:03:37,218 --> 00:03:38,980
海莉上次到医院看我以后
I was seeing Haley for the first time

112
00:03:38,980 --> 00:03:40,520
我还没有再见过她
since she came to visit me in the hospital.

113
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:42,660
她说了一些很深情的话
She said some pretty heavy stuff.

114
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,080
如果我就是你的大象
If I'm your elephant,

115
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:44,920
你是有机会追到我的
you have a shot.

116
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:47,020
我想说的就是这个 傻瓜
That's what I'm trying to say, dummy.

117
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,180
她不知道我听到了
She didn't know I heard.

118
00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:51,480
我花了一个星期想忘掉这句话
I tried for a couple weeks to forget about it

119
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:52,275
继续跟贝丝在一起
and just go on with Beth,

120
00:03:52,275 --> 00:03:55,627
但我没法不想着海莉
but I couldn't stop thinking about Haley.

121
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:59,380
所以我决定今天跟她摊牌
So... today's the day I'm finally gonna have the big talk.

122
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,820
后院有一冰柜的饮料 大家随意
There's a cooler of drinks out back! Help yourselves!

123
00:04:04,048 --> 00:04:05,357
海莉呢 她会来吗
Where's Haley? Is she coming?

124
00:04:05,357 --> 00:04:07,860
海莉上一次跟我说她的计划时 她说
The last time Haley informed me of her plans, she said,

125
00:04:07,860 --> 00:04:09,340
"我要去卡布了 不带你哦"
"Ha ha. I'm going to Cabo, and you're not."

126
00:04:09,980 --> 00:04:11,060
她最棒了
She's the best.

127
00:04:12,380 --> 00:04:16,320
准备面对你最棒的礼物吧
Get ready to see the best gift ever.

128
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,300
生日快乐
Happy birthday!

129
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,980
烧烤炉 我有一个烧烤炉了
It's a grill. I got a grill.

130
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:20,898
你以前也有一个老婆
You had a wife, too.

131
00:04:20,898 --> 00:04:22,488
但不代表你不能换一个
Didn't mean you couldn't trade up.

132
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:24,760
我送你的是巨焰牌烤炉
I give you the Flame XL.

133
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,958
我的客户是那家公司的老板
My client owns the company.

134
00:04:25,958 --> 00:04:27,639
他给了我一个超值大礼包
He gave me a crazy-good deal.

135
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:29,960
送了25000热单位的丙烷燃料
25,000 wood propane BTUs.

136
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,280
那...很多 是吧
That's... plenty, right?

137
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:33,380
不 这是电转烤肉架
No. Electric rotisserie!

138
00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:35,500
如果上帝想吃汉堡
If god wants a hamburger,

139
00:04:35,740 --> 00:04:37,260
她肯定是用这个来烤肉
this is what she cooks it on.

140
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:38,980
这么多没用的小玩意儿
But it's got all those doodads.

141
00:04:39,140 --> 00:04:40,680
我不知道要拿来干什么
I don't know what to do with those doodads.

142
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,140
你假装不兴奋
You're doing a great job

143
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:43,660
装得很好
of hiding your excitement about this gift.

144
00:04:43,900 --> 00:04:45,240
你看 很简单的
Look. It's simplicity itself.

145
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:47,680
打开气阀 点火
You just turn on the gas, hit the electric starter.

146
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:50,320
点火
Hit the electric starter.

147
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:51,800
菲尔 你可能要放一下手
Phil, you might want to lay off --

148
00:04:52,856 --> 00:04:53,753
我没事
I'm fine.

149
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:54,940
一如既往的健康
Healthy as ever.

150
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,320
我很清楚 我刚刚看到了你的X光片
I'd know if you weren't, 'cause I just saw your skeleton.

151
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,320
好了 乔
Okay, Joe.

152
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:02,260
该在你的新床上睡个午觉了
Time for a nap in your new bed!

153
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:06,679
你在找什么吗
Looking for something?

154
00:05:06,679 --> 00:05:08,748
对 找你
Uh, yeah -- you.

155
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,680
我想说你的派对办得太棒了
I just wanted to say what a nice party you put together.

156
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,980
秘密就是了解宾客们的喜好
The secret is to know what your guests want,

157
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,400
而我知道你想要什么
and I know what you want.

158
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:17,100
卢克 给你上一课
Hey, Luke, quick lesson.

159
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:19,920
这是杯垫 能避免杯子留水印
This is a coaster. It prevents rings.

160
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,800
真是多谢你的乐倍汽水
Thanks to you and your Dr pepper,

161
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:24,740
我楼上的柚木桌现在看起来像奥运旗
my teak end table upstairs looks like the olympic flag.

162
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,740
用脑子 卢克
Think, Luke.

163
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:27,960
是的 用脑子 卢克
Yes. Think, Luke.

164
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:33,180
你拿到了吗
Did you get it?

165
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:33,880
是的
Yep.

166
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,460
美妙的墨西哥宝藏
Sweet Mexican treasure.

167
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:37,420
我是在佛罗里达出生的 不过谢谢
I was born in Florida, but thank you.

168
00:05:37,948 --> 00:05:39,400
你真的决定要买了吗
So, you really think you're gonna buy it?

169
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,640
确实有必要
I mean, it makes sense.

170
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,900
我们现在住得有点挤
We're kind of cramped where we are.

171
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:44,080
她来了 我们的天才少女
There she is -- our little genius.

172
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:45,620
她刚被加州理工录取了
She just got accepted to Caltech.

173
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:46,700
太棒了
Oh, that's amazing!

174
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:47,940
没什么了不起的
It's not that big of a deal.

175
00:05:48,220 --> 00:05:49,440
很了不起
It's a huge deal!

176
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,700
这学校出的诺贝尔奖得主
That school pumps out Nobel prize winners

177
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:53,920
比我们学校被搞大肚子的女生一样多
the way my school pumped out stomachs.

178
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:54,840
妈 够了
Enough, mom!

179
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,740
你这是要干嘛
what was that about?

180
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,860
知道她被加州理工录取的时候
I didn't make a big enough fuss

181
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:01,080
我们表现得不够激动
about her getting into Caltech,

182
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,680
现在我该付出代价了
and now she's making me pay.

183
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,560
如果她的不爽只有这么点的话
Well, if that's her giving you a hard time,

184
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,080
那你应该很容易就混过去了
I think you got off pretty easy.

185
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,080
你说得没错
Well, that's true.

186
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:09,000
她基本没有叛逆期
That one never really went through a rebellious phase.

187
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,220
还记得我们以前有多疯狂吗
Remember how wild we were?

188
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:14,500
我们有吗
Were we ever!

189
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,060
我们有吗
Were we ever?

190
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,340
没有 没有
Not really, no.

191
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:21,180
你顶了一暑假的红色爆炸头
You had your summer of the red afro,

192
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:23,220
而我曾跟世上最白的波多黎各人约会
and I dated the whitest Puerto Rican on earth.

193
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,000
韦恩
Oh, Wayne.

194
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:27,100
但那不代表我们没有离开家
Hey, but it's not like we didn't separate

195
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:28,300
开始拼搏自己的人生
and strike out on our own.

196
00:06:28,300 --> 00:06:30,091
-对吗 -说得没错
- Am I right? - Yeah! That's right.

197
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,460
老爸给我买的房子
Dad bought me my house.

198
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,240
我们的也是
Ours, too.

199
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:35,000
他借给我们首付的钱
He loaned us the money for the down payment.

200
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,020
我们一直没还
We never paid him back.

201
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,380
我一直感觉很惭愧
I've always felt so guilty.

202
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,260
他也帮我们出了首付
You know, he gave us our down payment, too.

203
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,280
你确定不是送的吗
Are you sure that wasn't a gift?

204
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,180
我从来没说过要还他 我不知道
Well, I never offered to pay him back. I don't know.

205
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,940
他还刚给我发了一笔奖金
And then he just gave me this bonus at work.

206
00:06:45,028 --> 00:06:46,729
他该是怎么看我的啊
What he must think of me.

207
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:48,340
已经过去那么久了
It's so long ago now.

208
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:49,700
不管怎样
Well, still.

209
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:52,258
我觉得应该把钱还给他
I feel like I should offer to pay him back.

210
00:06:52,258 --> 00:06:54,360
什么 不不不 不要 克莱尔
What -- no. N-no. No, no, no, no, no, no, Claire.

211
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,640
那样我也得还他钱了
Because then I'm gonna have to pay him back,

212
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:57,320
那我就只能待在他上次给我买的
and I'll be stuck in the same shoe box

213
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,540
小鸽子笼里
he bought me last time.

214
00:06:58,540 --> 00:07:00,300
米奇尔 他不会收的
Mitchell, he's not going to accept it.

215
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,660
这只是一个姿态
It's just a gesture.

216
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,880
我们这么做只是想显得更独立
We do it so we feel more independent.

217
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:05,240
听我的
Just do it.

218
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:06,200
把钱还给他
Do it!

219
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:06,720
还什么
Do what?

220
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,000
没什么 你忙着呢
Oh, nothing. You're busy.

221
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:08,660
一点也不忙
Not really.

222
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:10,100
菲尔还在鼓捣新的烧烤机
Phil's tinkering with the new grill,

223
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:12,440
你最好开始准备他葬礼上用的旧照片了
so you better collect some old photographs for the memorial.

224
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:14,100
所以要还什么
Do what?

225
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,020
你可能不记得了
Well, you probably don't remember this.

226
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:19,460
但是之前
But, a while back,

227
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:22,280
你帮我们垫了房子的首付
you gave us some money for a down payment.

228
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,783
非常大方的举动 是的
Very generously, I might add. Yes.

229
00:07:24,783 --> 00:07:26,960
-这不只是因为你今天生日 -没错
- And not just cause it's your birthday... - That's right.

230
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:29,980
我们觉得至少应该提出
...but we wanted to at least make the offer

231
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:33,189
把钱还给你
to pay...you...back.

232
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,780
米奇尔 你在干什么 这我不能兑现
Mitchell, what are you doing? I can't cash this.

233
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:37,461
老爸 我
Now, dad, I--

234
00:07:37,461 --> 00:07:39,014
你得签字啊
You got to sign it first.

235
00:07:39,780 --> 00:07:40,900
那样的话
Okay, in that case,

236
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:42,380
我得把笔拿回来
I'm gonna need to get the pen back from--

237
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:42,760
克莱尔
Claire!

238
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,660
我这里就有
Got one right here.

239
00:07:44,140 --> 00:07:44,560
那好
Okay.

240
00:07:46,580 --> 00:07:47,420
你好啊
Hey, you.

241
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:51,880
我没想着能在这里见到你
I didn't expect to see you here today.

242
00:07:52,100 --> 00:07:52,880
你感觉怎么样了
How you feeling?

243
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,800
好多了 原来人没有阑尾也能活
Better. Turns out you don't even need an appendix.

244
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,440
我完全不想念我的阑尾
I don't even miss it anymore.

245
00:07:57,940 --> 00:07:58,700
它就像已消失的电路城一样
It's like Circuit City.

246
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:01,760
我一直有话想跟你说
Anyway, I've been wanting to talk to you about something.

247
00:08:01,860 --> 00:08:03,656
这房子太棒了
This house is fantastic.

248
00:08:03,656 --> 00:08:06,000
我应该做衣柜生意的
I should have gone into the closet business.

249
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:06,440
我说得没错吧
Right?

250
00:08:06,780 --> 00:08:08,840
我在领他参观呢 安迪 这是威尔
I'm giving him a tour. Andy, this is Will.

251
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:10,960
很高兴认识你
Nice to meet you.

252
00:08:12,980 --> 00:08:14,420
抱歉 我要接这个电话
I'm sorry. I have to take this.

253
00:08:14,540 --> 00:08:15,120
是医院的事
It's the hospital.

254
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:17,780
他是医生
He's a doctor.

255
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:20,580
我在去医院看你的那天遇见他的
I met him the same day I came to visit you in the hospital.

256
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:21,600
是不是很有趣
Isn't that funny?

257
00:08:23,274 --> 00:08:24,666
非常有趣
Super-funny.

258
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:26,720
对了 你想跟我说什么
So, wait. What did you want to talk to me about?

259
00:08:28,246 --> 00:08:31,319
就是这个小魔王
Just that this little heck-raiser

260
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:33,700
该午睡了 但他一直不肯上床
needs to take a nap, but he's been fighting it.

261
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:36,440
我有办法 卢克以前也这样
Oh, I've got an idea. Luke had the same problem.

262
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:39,280
我累了
I'm tired.

263
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:40,480
得上床睡觉觉
Let's go to bed.

264
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:41,720
我们一起吗
Both of us?

265
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:43,640
我们两个都要上来吗
Together? Me too?

266
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:47,140
是啊 因为我们困了 该睡午觉了
Yes, because we are sleepy and it's nap time!

267
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:49,240
等着吧 他会爬上床加入我们的
Now wait. He'll climb in bed with us.

268
00:08:50,020 --> 00:08:51,100
给他点时间
Just give him a minute.

269
00:08:53,180 --> 00:08:53,680
好吧
Okay.

270
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,740
既然我们都躺在床上
Since we're just lying here...

271
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,980
你还记得当你
do you remember when you --

272
00:08:57,980 --> 00:08:59,117
抱歉
Sorry about that.

273
00:08:59,117 --> 00:09:00,280
天呐
Oh! Gosh!

274
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,300
天呐
Oh, Gosh.

275
00:09:01,700 --> 00:09:02,580
你才出去两分钟
You're gone for two minutes,

276
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,900
回来就发现我们躺在一起
you come back and find us in the big-boy bed.

277
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,440
我知道你是怎么想的
I can only imagine what you're thinking.

278
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:07,680
你们是在哄小孩子睡觉吧
That you're trying to get this little kid to take a nap?

279
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:09,600
看他多聪明
How smart is he?

280
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:11,520
说几句医学用语
Say something medical.

281
00:09:12,220 --> 00:09:13,220
20cc 马上
20cc, stat.

282
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,500
我完全听不懂 但是听起来好刺激
I don't understand a word, but it gets me going.

283
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:21,289
这算什么购物政策啊
I mean, what kind of store policy is that?

284
00:09:21,289 --> 00:09:22,480
就因为我在家里穿了一次
I-I can't return a coat

285
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,660
就不能退了吗
that I put on one time at home?

286
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,220
你是刚洗完澡时穿的
Getting out of the shower.

287
00:09:26,420 --> 00:09:27,657
你把这事说出来一点帮助都没有
Yeah, you didn't help by pointing that out.

288
00:09:27,657 --> 00:09:28,940
你要怎么跟二爸说
What are you gonna tell daddy?

289
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:31,060
看来我只能告诉他 我犯了个错
Well, I guess I'm just gonna tell him I made a mistake.

290
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,120
我以前就说过
You know, like I say, sweetie,

291
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,200
诚实永远是最好的办法
honesty is always the best policy.

292
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:36,540
除非
Unless...

293
00:09:36,828 --> 00:09:38,177
跟着我的思路[留在这陪我]
and stay with me here...

294
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:39,300
不然我还能去哪里
Where would I go?

295
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,500
我跟你二爸说 让他先别买那套公寓
I convince your daddy to wait on the apartment upstairs

296
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:43,340
给我留出时间卖掉你的大衣
until I have enough time to sell your coat,

297
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:46,400
有必要的话 把我的也卖了
and, if need be, even sell mine.

298
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:49,520
先卖我的大衣 真是谢你了啊
Thanks for selling mine first, Dr. Chicago.

299
00:09:50,780 --> 00:09:52,380
如果我没读错的话
If I'm reading this properly,

300
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,540
我要放一片青柠在你嘴里
I'm supposed to put a lime in your mouth,

301
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:55,790
在肚皮上撒一点盐
salt on your stomach,

302
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:57,529
然后从肚脐眼里喝
and drink it out of your bellybutton.

303
00:09:58,140 --> 00:09:59,200
你想得美
You wish.

304
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:03,840
喝一口就爽飞天
That'll get you there.

305
00:10:08,335 --> 00:10:09,494
我的天
Whoa, nelly.

306
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:12,180
悠着点 这个酒后劲很大
Hey, pace yourself! This stuff is strong.

307
00:10:12,180 --> 00:10:14,000
我自有分寸
I'll know when I've had enough.

308
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,180
我把它点燃了
I got it lit.

309
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:17,806
在屋子里都感觉到了
I could feel it inside the house.

310
00:10:17,806 --> 00:10:19,520
法医以后需要牙科记录
They're gonna need dental records

311
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,640
才能辨认那些可怜的烤鸡了
to identify those chickens.

312
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,840
等我打开旋转烤叉
You'll be singing a different tune

313
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,640
你就会对它改观了
once I pop on the rotisserie feature.

314
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:27,280
准备好天旋地转吧
Get ready for these birds and your head to spin.

315
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:30,440
这转得也太快了吧
That's moving pretty fast.

316
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:31,620
调一下就好了
Simple adjustment.

317
00:10:31,667 --> 00:10:34,070
好像还加速了
That seems to have... sped it up.

318
00:10:34,335 --> 00:10:36,918
你能把我们的晚餐从泳池里捞出来吗
H-how about you skim dinner out of my pool?

319
00:10:36,918 --> 00:10:38,565
我去取旧的烤炉
I'll get my old grill out.

320
00:10:38,649 --> 00:10:40,980
为什么会有这种设置
Why is this even a setting?!

321
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:42,557
你跑到哪里去了 懦夫
Hey, where the hell did you go, you coward?

322
00:10:42,557 --> 00:10:44,440
就因为老爸拿了你的钱
Oh, what, just cause dad took your money back,

323
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,580
我就也要还钱给他吗
I'm supposed to give him all mine, too?

324
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:47,981
没错 因为是你出的蠢主意
Yes, yes. Because it was your stupid idea. Okay?

325
00:10:47,981 --> 00:10:49,280
天呐 我该怎么跟小卡说
Oh, my god. How am I gonna tell Cam

326
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,777
我把他继承的遗产都白白给人了
I gave away his entire inheritance?

327
00:10:50,777 --> 00:10:51,420
我不知道
I don't know.

328
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:54,457
这屋里是不是有个未来的医生啊
Oh, hey! Is there a future doctor in the house?

329
00:10:54,457 --> 00:10:56,500
是啊 在楼上和海莉亲热呢
Yeah, I think he's upstairs, feeling up Haley.

330
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:58,680
不 是你啊 艾利克斯·爱因斯坦
No -- you, Alex Einstein.

331
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,180
不管你在做什么 打住吧
Whatever you're doing, please stop.

332
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,660
她还在生气
She's still mad.

333
00:11:02,700 --> 00:11:03,400
我也是
Yeah, so am I.

334
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,940
这不公平
It's not fair, okay?

335
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:07,260
老爸给了你们一样的钱交首付
Dad gave you the same amount of money for your down payment.

336
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:09,760
什么 那钱是杰借的
What? Jay loaned us that money?

337
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:11,700
天呐 你不知道 没错
Oh, my god. You don't know. Yes. Yes.

338
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:13,380
让你怀疑她还扯了什么慌 对吧
Makes you wonder what else she's lied about, huh?

339
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:15,400
等等 我欠了杰20年钱
Wait -- I've owed jay money for 20 years,

340
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:16,260
你都没跟我说
and you never told me?

341
00:11:16,260 --> 00:11:17,640
我觉得你不会想要
I didn't think you'd want to take it.

342
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,400
我总算知道
I finally understand the invisible wall

343
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,880
我和杰之间为什么总是有隔阂了
that's been between jay and me all this time.

344
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:23,300
这就是为什么我们没在开那个疯狂烤炉的玩笑
This is why we're not laughing about that crazy grill,

345
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:25,220
在它旁边来张自拍
taking an awesome selfie with it,

346
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:26,317
发到社交网络上
posting it on Instagram,

347
00:11:26,317 --> 00:11:28,340
互发搞笑邮件
sending hilarious e-mails back and forth!

348
00:11:28,340 --> 00:11:29,420
"还记得那个破烤架吗"
"Remember when the grill went nuts?"

349
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,680
"记得 超搞笑"
"Oh, yeah. That was hilarious."

350
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:31,620
"你才搞笑呢"
"You're hilarious."

351
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,700
他不就是个医生吗
So what, he's a doctor?

352
00:11:34,020 --> 00:11:34,876
我也能当医生
I could be a doctor.

353
00:11:34,876 --> 00:11:35,672
在医院前台工作时
I still have the white coat

354
00:11:35,672 --> 00:11:37,720
穿的白大褂我还留着呢
from when I worked at the clinique counter.

355
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,900
歌洛莉亚说该给乔洗澡了
Hey. So, Gloria says it's Joe's bath time.

356
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:40,896
他刚洗过
He just had one.

357
00:11:40,896 --> 00:11:42,200
浴袍是怎么回事 赫夫
What's with the robe, Hef?

358
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,400
我不知道那是谁 我把衬衫脱了
I don't know who that is, but I took off my shirt

359
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,140
免得被这位神溅手弄湿
to protect it from splash Gordon over here.

360
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:47,480
好可爱
Adorbs.

361
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:48,820
能递下那盒果汁吗
Can you grab me that juice box?

362
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:49,760
好
Yeah, sure.

363
00:11:52,060 --> 00:11:52,460
话说回来...
Anyway...

364
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:54,560
就像我刚刚说的
Like I was saying before,

365
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,900
记得 我住院时
Remember how, when I was in the hospital --

366
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:58,040
不好了
Oh, no!

367
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,620
会留下印子的
Oh, man, this is gonna stain!

368
00:12:00,620 --> 00:12:02,160
得把它脱下来泡着
I need to take it off and soak it.

369
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:05,240
你可以穿我的衬衫 就在那里挂着
You could put on my shirt. It's hanging right there.

370
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,380
谢了
Oh, thanks.

371
00:12:09,260 --> 00:12:11,500
有点大 你有皮带吗
It's a little boxy. Do you have a chunky belt?

372
00:12:11,500 --> 00:12:13,489
有
Uh...yeah, I guess.

373
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,480
开玩笑的
I'm kidding.

374
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:17,480
反正我又不会穿很长时间
It's not like I'm gonna be wearing this for long anyways.

375
00:12:18,020 --> 00:12:19,580
这看起来很不妙啊
Wow. This looks bad.

376
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,919
这下更糟了
And this looks even worse.

377
00:12:20,919 --> 00:12:23,340
先听我解释
But there's a perfectly good explanation.

378
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:25,340
宝贝 是不是什么东西撒裙子上了
Hey, babe. You spill something on your dress?

379
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:27,080
没搞错吧 第一反应是这个啊
Really? That was your first guess?

380
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,620
是啊 给安迪递果汁的时候撒的
Yeah, I was giving Andy a juice box.

381
00:12:28,939 --> 00:12:31,160
不是我喝 我可是成年男人
Mm. Not to drink -- because I'm a man.

382
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:32,560
我去歌洛莉亚衣橱里
Okay, so, I'm gonna go get a dress

383
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,780
找裙子和鞋
and some shoes from Gloria's closet.

384
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,840
你的鞋怎么了
What happened to your shoes?

385
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:35,380
没怎么
Nothing.

386
00:12:38,380 --> 00:12:38,820
好吧
Okay.

387
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:41,320
我一直在观察你们两个
I've been watching the two of you,

388
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,860
事情很明显
and it's pretty obvious.

389
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:43,860
终于来了
Finally.

390
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:45,580
你总是能逗她笑
You know how to make her laugh.

391
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:47,760
我给海莉买了个小礼物
Anyway, I got haley a little gift,

392
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,200
我想在贺卡上写点好听的
and I want to write something cute on the card.

393
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:50,800
我觉得你能帮上忙 因为
I thought you could help me, because --

394
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,680
因为你不擅长写情话
Because you're not good with words.

395
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,140
我是个医生
Well, I'm a doctor.

396
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:55,758
我不会说自己有什么不擅长的
I can't admit I'm not good at something.

397
00:12:55,758 --> 00:12:57,699
但...拜托你了
But...please?

398
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,080
好吧
Yeah. Fine.

399
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:03,740
就写你自己的感觉
Just... write how you feel.

400
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,280
比如说
Something like...

401
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:08,880
亲爱的海莉 我知道眼睛如何转动
"Dear Haley, I know how eyes work,

402
00:13:08,900 --> 00:13:12,440
却不知道它们如何闪耀
But I never knew how they sparkled until I --"

403
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,040
那可能是黄斑变性
That could be macular degeneration.

404
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:14,960
你只管写就好
Just write.

405
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:18,160
我们得醒醒酒
We need to sober up.

406
00:13:18,767 --> 00:13:20,933
等我给前女友打个电话先
Right after I call an ex-girlfriend.

407
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,420
我觉得我还爱着她
I think I still love her.

408
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,266
抱歉 我们来晚了
Hey. Sorry we're late.

409
00:13:25,266 --> 00:13:26,740
没关系 别担心
No, that's fine. No worries.

410
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:28,500
听着 我的二货姐姐
Um, so, listen, my stupid sister --

411
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:29,880
我不想买那间公寓了
Look, I don't want that apartment anymore.

412
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:30,453
我也是
Oh, me neither.

413
00:13:30,453 --> 00:13:31,180
是的 就是...
Yeah, it's just that --

414
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:32,560
我还以为你铁了心想买呢
Well, I thought you had your heart set on it.

415
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:34,600
本来是 但你说得也很有道理
I did, but then you made such a compelling case.

416
00:13:34,740 --> 00:13:36,800
米奇 我必须得说 我真没想到
Hey, Mitch, I got to tell you, I was really impressed

417
00:13:36,800 --> 00:13:38,080
你会还我钱
with you paying back that loan.

418
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:39,620
抱歉 你说什么
I'm sorry. What? Excuse me?

419
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,360
抱歉 也该谢谢你
I'm sorry. I should be thanking you, too.

420
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:44,000
我都忘了帮你们付过首付
I forgot about that down payment I helped you guys with.

421
00:13:44,100 --> 00:13:45,220
好久以前的事了
It was so long ago.

422
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,380
不管怎么说
Anyway, yeah.

423
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:47,860
很棒的生日惊喜哦
Nice birthday surprise.

424
00:13:47,980 --> 00:13:49,280
你把我的钱给他了 是吧
You gave him my money, didn't you?

425
00:13:49,380 --> 00:13:51,020
你的钱 你不是说是我们的钱吗
Your money? I thought you said it was our money.

426
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:51,800
怎么会是我们的钱
Why would it be our money?

427
00:13:51,860 --> 00:13:53,050
你都不认识我雷穆斯舅舅
You didn't even know my uncle Remus.

428
00:13:53,050 --> 00:13:54,560
不是赛勒斯吗
Wasn't it Cyrus?

429
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:56,140
我想我会记得那个抚养我长大的
I think I would know the name of the saint

430
00:13:56,140 --> 00:13:57,320
圣人的名字
that practically raised me.

431
00:13:58,060 --> 00:14:00,480
我忘记给爷爷生日王冠了
I forgot to give grandpa his birthday crown.

432
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,540
等等 这是什么
Wait a minute. What's this?

433
00:14:02,500 --> 00:14:03,760
莉莉怎么有件毛皮大衣
Does Lily have a fur?

434
00:14:03,980 --> 00:14:04,720
糟糕
Oh, boy.

435
00:14:04,856 --> 00:14:05,730
是啊 瞧瞧
Yeah, uh, let's see.

436
00:14:05,730 --> 00:14:07,440
还是施瓦茨曼家的呢
Oh, it's from Schwartzman's, huh?

437
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:08,840
那不就是你和莉莉每周日
The same store that you and Lily

438
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:11,020
吃完早午餐喜欢去逛的店吗
just love to browse in every sunday after brunch.

439
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:14,440
好 告诉你吧 这是给你的惊喜礼物
Well, if you must know, it was a surprise gift for you.

440
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:16,840
现在我要退回去 因为你是个小偷
Now it's going back, because you're a thief.

441
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:18,159
-既然这样我要试试 -不行
- Oh, well, then, I want to try it on. - No!

442
00:14:18,159 --> 00:14:19,298
-我要试穿一下 -你会爱上它的
- I want to try it on. - You'll just get attached.

443
00:14:19,298 --> 00:14:20,600
既然是给我的礼物
Well, it's a present for me,

444
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:22,800
那是不是该符合我的尺码呢
so I should be able to have a fitting of some sort.

445
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:24,860
当然需要修改一下了
Of course it needs altering.

446
00:14:24,860 --> 00:14:26,520
不可能从架子上拿下来就穿着合适啊
Since when do you wear right off the rack?

447
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:33,440
我只是不太习惯用那个维苏威火山
I'm just not comfortable with Vesuvius over there.

448
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,940
我希望你能要回你的钱
I hope you can get your money back.

449
00:14:35,380 --> 00:14:36,460
"要回钱" 就是这个
"Money back" -- there it is.

450
00:14:37,140 --> 00:14:38,400
我们之间的关系
There's a shadow that's been cast

451
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,279
笼罩着一层阴影 经久不散
over this relationship for quite a while now.

452
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:42,280
你是在说那次你梦游
Is this about that time you were sleepwalking

453
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:44,035
走进我的帐篷 亲了我的脖子吗
and came in my tent and kissed my neck?

454
00:14:44,035 --> 00:14:45,340
那是梦游求爱症
Somnamorousness --

455
00:14:45,340 --> 00:14:47,120
一种没人愿意谈论的病症
the condition no one wants to talk about.

456
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:48,000
你说对了
You're right about that.

457
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:50,120
这其实更让人难堪
This is actually much more embarrassing.

458
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:52,400
我刚得知你借钱给我们付房子的首付
I just found out you lent us money for our down payment.

459
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,040
所以...
So...

460
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:55,480
给你
Here.

461
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:57,640
全额还给你
Paid back in full.

462
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,700
菲尔 这是因为米奇尔...
Phil, is this because Mitchell --

463
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:01,760
不 这是为了我 为了我们
No. This is for me -- for us.

464
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,700
而且这感谢也许有点迟了
And though it may be long overdue,

465
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:04,440
不过还是谢谢你
thank you.

466
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:06,400
不客气
You're welcome.

467
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:11,060
可能看起来有点尴尬 不过...
Probably seems awkward, but...

468
00:15:11,060 --> 00:15:11,640
真的发生了
It's happening.

469
00:15:12,020 --> 00:15:13,700
你能帮我系上围裙吗
...could you throw that apron on me?

470
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:21,620
你不是又睡着了吧
You're not sleeping again?

471
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:26,300
也许我们该再喝一壶咖啡
Maybe we should have another pot of coffee.

472
00:15:26,620 --> 00:15:29,480
那词可真怪 咖啡 咖啡 咖啡
That's a weird word, huh? Coffee. Coffee. Coffee.

473
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:30,380
真外行
Amateur.

474
00:15:30,860 --> 00:15:32,540
医生 我需要你的帮助
Doctor! I need your help.

475
00:15:32,780 --> 00:15:34,200
我在喝这瓶龙舌兰酒
I've been drinking this tequila,

476
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,920
可我找不到蠕虫了
and I cannot find the worm.

477
00:15:36,180 --> 00:15:37,560
我想可能是被我吞了
I think I just swallow it.

478
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:38,800
那很严重
That's very serious.

479
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,960
蠕虫在几小时内就能吞食你的内脏
That worm could eat your insides in a matter of hours.

480
00:15:41,020 --> 00:15:42,580
一定有什么办法可以抢救吧
Well, there must be something she can do.

481
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:43,880
喝腌黄瓜汁
Drink pickle juice.

482
00:15:44,220 --> 00:15:46,320
蠕虫在腌黄瓜汁里无法存活
The worm cannot survive in pickle juice.

483
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:47,780
-这些够了吗 -刚好
- Is this enough? - Just.

484
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:52,240
谢谢你 医生 我已经感觉好多了
Thank you, doctor. I'm feeling better already.

485
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,200
你很幸运
You got lucky.

486
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,580
另一个治疗办法是泡在冰水浴缸里
The only other treatment is to freeze the worm to death

487
00:15:55,580 --> 00:15:58,100
使体温降低从而将蠕虫冻死
by lowering the body temperature with an ice bath.

488
00:15:58,949 --> 00:16:00,940
我觉得它在我体内蠕动
I feel it inside of me.

489
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:02,800
不 我觉得在我身体里
No. I think it's inside of me.

490
00:16:02,848 --> 00:16:05,640
我就知道应该把龙舌兰倒进你肚脐里的
I knew we should've poured the tequila in your bellybutton.

491
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,240
这些规矩是有存在的道理的
That's why they have these systems in place.

492
00:16:11,140 --> 00:16:12,960
我听见一部昂贵的轿车开走了
I heard an expensive car pull out.

493
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:14,580
我以为你在里面呢
I figured you were in it.

494
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:16,340
是啊 威尔回医院去了
Oh, yeah, that was Will going to the hospital.

495
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,480
我只是来拿我的裙子
I just came to get my dress.

496
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:22,120
他给我一张卡片 不过字迹太潦草了
Um, he gave me this card, but he writes like a doctor.

497
00:16:22,140 --> 00:16:23,160
你能给我读一下吗
Can you read it for me?

498
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:26,558
不 那是你们的隐私
No. That sounds way too personal.

499
00:16:26,558 --> 00:16:29,600
拜托 我都去医院看你了
Ohh, come on! I visited you in the hospital.

500
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:30,559
读吧
Just do it!

501
00:16:30,559 --> 00:16:31,660
不了
Nah, I'm okay.

502
00:16:31,660 --> 00:16:33,160
你看看能不能认出来嘛 我看不懂
Can you just see if you can read it? I can't.

503
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:33,660
还是算了
I'd rather not.

504
00:16:33,700 --> 00:16:34,420
你识字吗
Can you even read?

505
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:36,380
-试一下好吗 -好吧 我试试
- Can you please try? - I'll try. Yeah, no, I'll try.

506
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:37,260
-谢谢你 -不客气
- Thank you. - You're welcome.

507
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:41,620
亲爱的海莉 我知道眼睛如何转动
"Dear Haley, I know how eyes work,

508
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:43,860
但直到遇见你 我才知道
but I never knew how they sparkled

509
00:16:43,860 --> 00:16:45,180
它们有多么闪耀
until I met you.

510
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:47,080
我知道心脏如何跳动
I know how hearts work,

511
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:49,040
但直到遇见你 我才知道
but I never knew they could sing

512
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,900
它会歌唱
until I met you.

513
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:52,460
爱你的威尔
Love, Will."

514
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:54,660
该死
Oh, crap.

515
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,560
是吗 我觉得写得挺甜蜜的
Really? I thought it was kind of sweet.

516
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:00,820
以医生的口吻来写他对你的感觉
The doctor part, then it circled around back to you.

517
00:17:00,860 --> 00:17:02,660
他为什么要这么喜欢我呢
Why does he have to be so into me, you know?

518
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:04,000
我们两周前才认识
We met like two weeks ago.

519
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,220
心形金项链 开什么玩笑
A gold heart! Really?

520
00:17:06,420 --> 00:17:09,180
我只是 我想我更喜欢追求的过程
I just -- I guess I'm just more into the chase right now.

521
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:10,920
你知道的 那种乐趣
You know, like, the fun.

522
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,760
我还不想开始认真的恋爱关系
I'm just not looking for anything serious.

523
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:16,840
你知道想要什么 这很好
Well, it's good you know what you want --

524
00:17:16,840 --> 00:17:18,180
免得最后大家都受伤害
Before anyone got hurt.

525
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:19,400
是啊
Yeah.

526
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:20,720
谢谢
Thanks.

527
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,458
我当然有收据了
Of course I have the receipt.

528
00:17:27,458 --> 00:17:29,586
要是没有怎么办
Ow!...Kay, what if I didn't?

529
00:17:29,700 --> 00:17:30,700
她来了
Oh, there she is!

530
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:33,040
各位 让我们举起酒杯
Okay, everybody, I want to make a toast!

531
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:34,020
又找借口喝酒
Oh, any excuse.

532
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:36,200
敬我才华横溢的女儿...
To my brilliant daughter...

533
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:37,420
不是你
So, not you.

534
00:17:37,500 --> 00:17:40,660
努力了12年终于考进加州理工大学
...who worked for 12 years to get into Caltech,

535
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:43,140
最有威望的学院...
the most prestigious college --

536
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,558
妈妈 真的没什么大不了的
Mom, it's really not a big deal.

537
00:17:44,558 --> 00:17:46,380
亲爱的 等等等等 你自己说过的
Oh, honey, wait, wait, wait -- you said yourself

538
00:17:46,380 --> 00:17:49,120
那是全国最好的科学家学校
it's the best scientist school in the country.

539
00:17:49,220 --> 00:17:51,320
我绝对没有用那些字眼
Well, I most definitely did not use those words.

540
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:52,860
恭喜你 艾丽克斯
Congratulations, Alex.

541
00:17:52,860 --> 00:17:54,820
我们相信你会有很大的成就
We expect great things from you --

542
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:57,240
不像这个家里的某些其他孩子
unlike some of the other children in this family.

543
00:17:57,700 --> 00:17:59,020
我钓到了一个医生
Well, I snagged a doctor,

544
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:00,620
所以她一定是在说你
so she must be talking about you.

545
00:18:01,380 --> 00:18:02,900
我非常为你自豪
I'm very proud of you.

546
00:18:03,860 --> 00:18:05,740
行了 我还没做决定呢
Okay, well, I haven't even decided.

547
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:07,320
我还是可能去上我的保底学校
I still might go to my safety school.

548
00:18:07,780 --> 00:18:08,960
这下可好
Great. Now this.

549
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:09,900
要是她决定上另外那所大学
If she goes to the other place,

550
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:10,900
学费会更高
it's even more expensive.

551
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:12,800
不会的 拜托
It's not gonna happen. Please.

552
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,440
她只是在惩罚我
She's just trying to punish me.

553
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:16,620
而且别担心钱的事 有我的奖金呢
And don't worry about the money. I got my bonus.

554
00:18:17,180 --> 00:18:17,580
是啊
Yeah.

555
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,040
慢着 怎么了 你做了什么
Wait. What? What did you do?

556
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:22,024
你还钱给我爸了吗 拜托你说是的
Did you pay back my dad? Please, please, please.

557
00:18:22,024 --> 00:18:22,940
-不是吧 -是的 我还了
- No, no, no. - Yes, I did.

558
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:24,400
但并没有改变什么
Not that it changed anything.

559
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:25,580
好了 别生菲尔的气
Okay, don't be mad at Phil.

560
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:27,480
他不是这里的恶人 他才是
He's not the bad guy here. He is.

561
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:28,600
瞧瞧他 坐在那里
Look at him, sitting over there

562
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:30,140
好像他是全世界的国王似的
like he's the king of the world.

563
00:18:30,340 --> 00:18:32,340
什么样的父亲会收儿女的钱啊
What father takes money from his own children?

564
00:18:32,540 --> 00:18:34,039
他又不需要 他住在这个宫殿里
Not like he needs it. He lives in this palace.

565
00:18:34,039 --> 00:18:35,364
而我们全家人
Meanwhile, our whole family's

566
00:18:35,364 --> 00:18:37,418
共用一间跟他家衣橱一样大的卫生间
sharing a bathroom the size of his closet.

567
00:18:37,418 --> 00:18:38,680
我知道 我用脚量过的
I know. I've paced it out.

568
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,720
好吧 那我呢
Okay, what about me?

569
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:40,940
我眼里还含着泪呢
My tears have barely dried,

570
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:41,720
他就偷走了我继承的遗产
he stole my inheritance,

571
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,440
而我却成买了两件毛皮大衣的罪人
and I'm left holding the bag for two fur coats.

572
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,481
两件
T-two?!

573
00:18:44,520 --> 00:18:46,120
那件大衣我可以穿三季
I can get three seasons of use out of it.

574
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:48,180
这可能会把你们逗笑
Hey, this might give you a chuckle.

575
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:50,019
你们还给我的那些钱
That money you all paid me back --

576
00:18:50,019 --> 00:18:52,208
刚好够我买下那辆雷鸟
It's gonna cover the cost of that t-bird.

577
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,762
事情的发展是不是很好笑
Isn't that funny how stuff works out?

578
00:18:53,762 --> 00:18:55,672
-的确好笑 -超好笑的
- It sure is funny. - That's hilarious.

579
00:18:57,140 --> 00:18:59,220
我做不到 太冷了
I can't. It's too cold.

580
00:18:59,460 --> 00:19:00,317
要么现在冷五分钟
It's either cold for

581
00:19:00,317 --> 00:19:02,420
要么就变冰冷的尸体
5 minutes or cold forever.

582
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:04,500
快点
Come on.

583
00:19:08,900 --> 00:19:12,160
说来好笑 我一直以为我会穿着鸟服
Funny -- I always thought I'd be found dead in a bird suit

584
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:13,540
摔死在大峡谷谷底
at the bottom of the Grand Canyon.

585
00:19:13,800 --> 00:19:14,660
你还是会的 兄弟
You still will, buddy.

586
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:16,060
你还是会的
You still will.

587
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:20,440
要是再被我抓到你们喝酒
If I ever catch you drinking again,

588
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:22,680
你们全校的同学都会看到这张照片
your whole school is going to see this picture.

589
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,508
她骗了我们
Sh-sh-she tricked us.

590
00:19:25,847 --> 00:19:26,653
是啊
I know.

591
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:29,780
等我们冻死这只虫子 就去找她算账
As soon as we kill this worm, we're gonna get her back.

592
00:19:30,604 --> 00:19:32,448
根本 没有 虫子
There's...no...worm!

593
00:19:34,900 --> 00:19:36,200
没用的 孩子
Not gonna help, kid.

594
00:19:37,300 --> 00:19:38,060
你说得对
You're right.

595
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:39,900
我不能用酒精麻醉自己的问题
I can't drown my problems in alcohol.

596
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:42,400
你可以 但那里面是水
Well, you can, but that's water.

597
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,700
你真的打算放弃加州理工吗
You're not really gonna turn down Caltech?

598
00:19:46,040 --> 00:19:47,939
拜托不要跟我说那所大学有多好
Oh, please don't tell me what a great school it is,

599
00:19:47,939 --> 00:19:49,260
我会在两年内毕业
how I'm gonna graduate in two years,

600
00:19:49,260 --> 00:19:50,640
人们会以我的名字命名一个国家什么的
and they're gonna name a country after me.

601
00:19:50,660 --> 00:19:51,560
你有压力
You're feeling some pressure.

602
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:53,840
万一我是那里最蠢的学生怎么办
What if I'm the dumbest one there?

603
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:55,160
总得有人是最蠢的
Someone has to be.

604
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,500
我可以去那里 做个蠢学生
I could get there, be dumb,

605
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:57,380
精神崩溃
have a nervous breakdown --

606
00:19:57,760 --> 00:19:59,380
你会去的 我了解你
You're going. I know you.

607
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:02,180
你长这么大从没有在挑战面前退缩过
You've never backed down from a challenge your whole life.

608
00:20:02,220 --> 00:20:04,620
现在我可以骗你 告诉你一切会很轻松
Now, I could lie to you and tell you it's gonna be easy.

609
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,442
那样好啊 我现在很脆弱
Well, do that. I'm vulnerable.

610
00:20:06,442 --> 00:20:06,951
我会相信你
I'll believe you.

611
00:20:06,951 --> 00:20:08,276
不会的 会很艰难
It's not. It's gonna be hard.

612
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:11,240
但你我都知道 这是你必须要做的事
But you and I both know this is something you have to do.

613
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:14,880
因为如果我不去 我会后悔一辈子
'cause if I don't, I'll regret it my whole life.

614
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:15,440
是的 是的
I know, I know.

615
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,399
是的 那是一部分原因
Yeah, that's part of it.

616
00:20:16,399 --> 00:20:18,587
我带你去兜个风 有些东西要让你看看
Let's take a ride. Want to show you something.

617
00:20:19,340 --> 00:20:21,000
你不是要带我去贫民区
You're not gonna drive me into a bad neighborhood

618
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,580
让我看看自己有多幸运吧
to show me how lucky I am, are you?

619
00:20:25,820 --> 00:20:27,460
要不是她耍了米奇尔
Well, I would still have my money

620
00:20:27,460 --> 00:20:28,800
我也不会失去我的钱
if she hadn't tricked Mitchell.

621
00:20:28,900 --> 00:20:30,760
你的钱没了真是太糟了啊 小卡
Oh, and it's a shame you don't, Cam.

622
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:32,800
不然你就可以再买一件那样的大衣了
'cause then you could buy another one of those coats.

623
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,700
我没得到任何我想要的东西
Well, I didn't get anything I wanted!

624
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:36,680
杰都不喜欢那台世界上最完美的烧烤架
Jay didn't even like the world's most perfect grill.

625
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:38,840
不是吧
Come on!

626
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:41,000
这个家庭需要一个领导
The family needs a leader,

627
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,040
而我没法永远做那个领导
and I can't do it forever.

628
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:43,400
你能胜任的
You can handle it.

629
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:45,180
我一定要吗
Do I have to?

630
00:20:46,220 --> 00:20:47,720
欲戴王冠 必承其重
Heavy hangs the head.

631
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:53,600
大学可能并不会那么可怕
You know, college might not be such a big, scary place

632
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:54,581
要是我能开着...
if I drove up the first --

633
00:20:54,581 --> 00:20:55,691
-别做梦了 -好吧
- Not gonna happen. - Okay.

634
00:20:57,995 --> 00:21:00,320
你弟弟现在财务上有点紧张
Your brother's in a bit of a spot money-wise,

635
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:01,600
我不想让他难堪
and I don't want to embarrass him,

636
00:21:01,600 --> 00:21:02,480
所以要不就说是我
so how about if I say

637
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,720
送你们两个每人一份礼物
I'm giving you both a gift?

638
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:06,000
那样他就不会觉得自己是被同情的对象了
That way, he doesn't feel like a charity case.

639
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:07,900
如果是为了帮米奇尔的话
Well, if it's to help Mitchell...

640
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:08,680
谢了 乖女儿
Thank you, honey.

641
00:21:10,303 --> 00:21:12,464
还是好冷
S-still s-so cold.

642
00:21:12,464 --> 00:21:15,005
也许喝点咖啡会暖和些
M-maybe some coffee would warm us up.

643
00:21:15,606 --> 00:21:16,660
你上瘾了吧
You have a problem.

644
00:21:16,660 --> 00:21:17,960
听着 要不就说是我
So, listen, how about if I say

645
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:19,200
送你们两个每人一份礼物
I'm giving you both a gift?

646
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:20,200
那样你姐姐就...
That way, your sister --

647
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:20,720
我们收下了
We'll take it.

648
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:21,440
是的
Yeah.

649
00:21:21,740 --> 00:21:23,140
莉莉 我们可以去买帽子了
Lily, we can get the hats.

650
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:24,261
好耶
Yeah!
